<#78ff8c>POWERED SHELL  (BARRIER)</>
Powered Shell		^X
  A shell floats around him and stops special and super
  attacks, melee and projectiles. Normals still hit him.
  One at a time. It wears out after a while or a few
  blocked hits, then fires off as a shot.
Powered Shell (normal on contact)		^X
Power Charge (hold)		^B_+^C

<#78ff8c>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves him
  open.
Grab		^Y
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on him passes 15% of his life.
Guard Cancel (blocking, 750 meter)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B

<#78ff8c>NORMALS</>
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Light Kick		_B^A
Crouching Light / Medium		_D^A / _D^B
Sweep		_D^C
Launcher		_DF^C
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C

<#78ff8c>SPECIALS</>
  The C version is the EX (1250 meter, a quarter of his gauge).
Eraser Shot (air too)		_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Gigantic Strike		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C
  Jumping grab. EX: ground bounce and control back.
Gigantic Claw		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Bloody Stomp (air)		_D_D^A / ^B
  Dives down. The landing shockwave hits OTG and pops them
  up: cancel into a super.
EX Bloody Stomp (air, 1250 meter)		_D_D^C
  Stomps on them three times. The last one stands them up
  dizzy so he can follow up.

